JEV Broker is a standalone subscriber-facing adaptation of the MIT-licensed
system-one-connector by Mostafa:
https://github.com/itsmostafa/system-one-connector

This package adds a local HTTP MCP Broker, per-profile bearer authentication,
agent-defined noul/choice/score requests, and subscriber setup guidance.
